        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The Getaway is a sandbox crime game set in London. It is inspired by British gangland films Get Carter and Snatch. Initially, the release of the game was to coincide with the launch of the PlayStation 2 in 2000, but was delayed by 27 months due to the difficulty of re-creating large areas of London in high resolution. Parts of The Getaway feature in various episodes of Graham Duff's Ideal.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "The Getaway es un juego de crimen de mundo abierto ambientado en Londres. Se inspira en las películas británicas de mafiosos Get Carter y Snatch. En un principio, el lanzamiento del juego iba a coincidir con el de PlayStation 2 en 2000, pero se retrasó 27 meses por la dificultad de recrear en alta resolución grandes zonas de Londres. Fragmentos de The Getaway aparecen en varios episodios de Ideal, de Graham Duff.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2002",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
